9b4.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "arabic": "اُمْكُرْ", "plain": "اُمْكُرْ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/f3ae59c2f2ca8ad33b03.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اُمْكُرِي", "plain": "اُمْكُرِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/c46760d95267125b5972.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اُمْكُرَا", "plain": "اُمْكُرَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/2090716a90e2339b5e71.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "اُمْكُرُوا", "plain": "اُمْكُرُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/dcc0eed9015c9210f8a5.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اُمْكُرْنَ", "plain": "اُمْكُرْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/2e73e47e1636e86ddd2d.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "27:70", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3229.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And grieve thou not for them, nor be in distress because of what they plot (against thee).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(Habibim!) Onlara karşı mahzun olma, kurmakta oldukları tuzaklardan ötürü de sıkıntı duyma!", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تم ان پر غم نہ کھاؤ اور ان کے مکر سے دل تنگ نہ ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan janganlah kamu berduka cita terhadap mereka, dan janganlah (dadamu) merasa sempit terhadap apa yang mereka tipudayakan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَحْزَنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَكُن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ضَيْقٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَمْكُرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c75bcbeb42939d58fe41.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "spletkare", "en": "they plot", "tr": "tuzak kurarlar", "fr": "ils ourdissent une ruse", "id": "mereka membuat tipu daya", "ur": "وہ چال چلتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করে", "fa": "نیرنگ می‌زنند"}}]}, {"ref": "71:22", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5441.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they have plotted a mighty plot,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Büyük büyük tuzaklar kurdular.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور بہت بڑا داؤ ں کھیلے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan melakukan tipu-daya yang amat besar\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمَكَرُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8b324ab278b15da2c68b.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i smišljali su spletku", "en": "and they plotted", "tr": "ve tuzak kurdular", "fr": "et ils ourdirent une ruse", "id": "dan mereka membuat tipu daya", "ur": "اور انہوں نے چال چلی", "bn": "এবং তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করল", "fa": "و نیرنگ زدند"}}, {"text": "مَكْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُبَّارًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "3:54", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/347.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they (the disbelievers) schemed, and Allah schemed (against them): and Allah is the best of schemers.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar hileye başvurdular, Allah da onların tuzağını boşa çıkardı. Allah hileleri boşa çıkaranların en hayırlısıdır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور کافروں نے مکر کیا اور اللہ نے ان کے ہلاک کی خفیہ تدبیر فرمائی اور اللہ سب سے بہتر چھپی تدبیر والا ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Orang-orang kafir itu membuat tipu daya, dan Allah membalas tipu daya mereka itu. Dan Allah sebaik-baik pembalas tipu daya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمَكَرُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ecb034fa6b8f6f369bcb.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i smišljali su spletku", "en": "and they plotted", "tr": "ve tuzak kurdular", "fr": "et ils ourdirent une ruse", "id": "dan mereka membuat tipu daya", "ur": "اور انہوں نے چال چلی", "bn": "এবং তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করল", "fa": "و نیرنگ زدند"}}, {"text": "وَمَكَرَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/62565973979c8d456fc8.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and he/it plotted", "bs": "i spletkario je", "tr": "ve entrika çevirdi", "fr": "et il a comploté", "id": "dan dia merencanakan", "ur": "اور اُس نے سازش کی", "bn": "এবং সে ষড়যন্ত্র করল", "fa": "و توطئه کرد"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَيْرُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمَٰكِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "27:50", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3209.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So they plotted a plot: and We plotted a plot, while they perceived not.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar böyle bir tuzak kurdular, biz de kendileri farkında olmadan onların planlarını altüst ettik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "او رانہوں نے اپنا سا مکر کیا اور ہم نے اپنی خفیہ تدبیر فرمائی اور وہ غافل رہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan merekapun merencanakan makar dengan sungguh-sungguh dan Kami merencanakan makar (pula), sedang mereka tidak menyadari.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمَكَرُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ecb034fa6b8f6f369bcb.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i smišljali su spletku", "en": "and they plotted", "tr": "ve tuzak kurdular", "fr": "et ils ourdirent une ruse", "id": "dan mereka membuat tipu daya", "ur": "اور انہوں نے چال چلی", "bn": "এবং তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করল", "fa": "و نیرنگ زدند"}}, {"text": "مَكْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَكَرْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/bcdffcfcc98cfdce9c5a.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and we plotted", "bs": "i spletkarili smo", "tr": "ve entrika çevirdik", "fr": "et nous avons comploté", "id": "dan kami telah merencanakan", "ur": "اور ہم نے سازش کی", "bn": "এবং আমরা ষড়যন্ত্র করেছি", "fa": "و توطئه کردیم"}}, {"text": "مَكْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَمْكُرُونَ", "count": 6, "first": "6:123", "audio": "audio/02f8246e5c1a3d211df7.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "spletkare", "en": "they plot", "tr": "tuzak kurarlar", "fr": "ils ourdissent une ruse", "id": "mereka membuat tipu daya", "ur": "وہ چال چلتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করে", "fa": "نیرنگ می‌زنند"}}, {"arabic": "وَمَكَرُوا۟", "count": 3, "